{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53393","headline":"赠释空海歌 · 胡伯崇","name":"赠释空海歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"说四句，演毗尼，凡夫听者尽归依。\n天假吾师多伎术，就中草圣最狂逸，不可得，难再见。\n（见日僧真济《遍照发挥性灵集序》，见《日本古典文学大系》七一册空海《性灵集》卷首）（按：《全唐诗逸》卷中录此诗，缺末二句，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡伯崇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}